" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135645515,imgsize-54330.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Houston mayor says 'elections matter', won't help ICE as Democrats sweep Texas: 'I do this to begin a healing process']]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135644019.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/houston-mayor-says-elections-matter-wont-help-ice-as-democrats-sweep-texas-i-do-this-to-begin-a-healing-process/articleshow/135644019.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/houston-mayor-says-elections-matter-wont-help-ice-as-democrats-sweep-texas-i-do-this-to-begin-a-healing-process/articleshow/135644019.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-08T00:05:11+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Poulomi Ghosh</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135644187,imgsize-51170.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Wallace's 170-year-old moth rediscovery helps identify 11 new species]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135537442.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/wildlife/a-moth-collected-by-alfred-russel-wallace-nearly-170-years-ago-was-rediscovered-in-a-museum-drawer-and-helped-identify-11-new-species/articleshow/135537442.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/wildlife/a-moth-collected-by-alfred-russel-wallace-nearly-170-years-ago-was-rediscovered-in-a-museum-drawer-and-helped-identify-11-new-species/articleshow/135537442.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-08T03:00:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135537565,imgsize-759358.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Arkansas couple win right to complete 111-acre land purchase after years of instalments]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135598180.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Destin and Jennifer Clark faced a legal battle over a land purchase in Magazine, Arkansas. They initially struggled with payments and entered various agreements with the sellers, George and Sandra Thomas. A dispute arose regarding the sellers' refusal to provide a signed payoff amount, which the Clarks needed to finalize the sale. The Arkansas Court of Appeals affirmed the lower court's ruling, allowing the Clarks to complete the purchase.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2015-an-arkansas-couple-began-buying-111-acres-on-instalments-later-handing-over-a-truck-and-cows-to-catch-up-when-the-seller-resisted-closing-an-appeals-court-upheld-their-right-to-complete-the-sale/articleshow/135598180.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2015-an-arkansas-couple-began-buying-111-acres-on-instalments-later-handing-over-a-truck-and-cows-to-catch-up-when-the-seller-resisted-closing-an-appeals-court-upheld-their-right-to-complete-the-sale/articleshow/135598180.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-08T01:48:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135598345,imgsize-2063178.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Scientists discovered hundreds of sensory hair cells across squid body, insight into human hearing]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135629743.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Research conducted at Case Western Reserve University has uncovered that squids possess sensory hair cells throughout their bodies. These cells grant squids an exceptional ability to perceive local water movements, akin to how humans detect sound through their ears. The variation in hair bundle lengths allows for the discernment of different water motion frequencies.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/discovery/scientists-discovered-hundreds-of-sensory-hair-cells-across-the-entire-surface-of-squid-bodies-not-just-their-heads-and-arms-the-finding-may-offer-a-new-way-to-study-how-human-hearing-cells-fail/articleshow/135629743.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/discovery/scientists-discovered-hundreds-of-sensory-hair-cells-across-the-entire-surface-of-squid-bodies-not-just-their-heads-and-arms-the-finding-may-offer-a-new-way-to-study-how-human-hearing-cells-fail/articleshow/135629743.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-08T01:50:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Lifestyle Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135630100,imgsize-71243.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Meet 15-year-old Rodion Zaichikov, the Luxembourg student who won the Ellison Scholars Prize]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135629543.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[At just 15 years old, Rodion Zaichikov has made waves in the scientific community with his innovative arc-jet wind tunnel designed for scramjet testing, which earned him the prestigious Ellison Scholars Prize at Germany's European Union Contest for Young Scientists. By creating equipment to mimic extreme flight conditions—typically costly and hard to access—Zaichikov showcases his dedication to pioneering aerospace solutions.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/discovery/meet-15-year-old-rodion-zaichikov-the-luxembourg-student-who-built-an-arc-jet-wind-tunnel-to-test-a-scramjet-above-3000c-and-won-the-ellison-scholars-prize-at-europes-young-scientist-contest/articleshow/135629543.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/discovery/meet-15-year-old-rodion-zaichikov-the-luxembourg-student-who-built-an-arc-jet-wind-tunnel-to-test-a-scramjet-above-3000c-and-won-the-ellison-scholars-prize-at-europes-young-scientist-contest/articleshow/135629543.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-08T01:55:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Lifestyle Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135629609,imgsize-62128.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Virginia restaurant gets $51,594 water bill after meter fault hid usage for years]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135538147.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-virginia-restaurant-received-a-51594-water-bill-after-paying-almost-nothing-for-three-years-a-damaged-meter-transmitter-had-been-recording-zero-consumption/articleshow/135538147.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-virginia-restaurant-received-a-51594-water-bill-after-paying-almost-nothing-for-three-years-a-damaged-meter-transmitter-had-been-recording-zero-consumption/articleshow/135538147.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-08T02:00:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135538207,imgsize-1210710.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[10 years of the Paris Agreement, top 10 carbon emitters of the world; where does India stand]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135630304.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Natural disasters have spotlighted the urgent link between climate change and escalating global carbon emissions. The 2025 Global Carbon Budget predicts fossil fuel emissions will soar to unprecedented levels. Although India is among the top three carbon emitters, its per-capita emissions are significantly lower compared to China and the U.S.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/10-years-of-the-paris-agreement-who-are-the-top-10-carbon-emitters-of-the-world-and-where-does-india-stand/articleshow/135630304.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/10-years-of-the-paris-agreement-who-are-the-top-10-carbon-emitters-of-the-world-and-where-does-india-stand/articleshow/135630304.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-08T00:50:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Lifestyle Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135630645,imgsize-99335.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Mary Pope Osborne donates 1.2 million books to children across the US]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135454189.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/magic-tree-house-author-mary-pope-osborne-has-donated-more-than-1-2-million-books-to-children-in-underserved-us-schools-through-her-gift-of-books-programme/articleshow/135454189.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/magic-tree-house-author-mary-pope-osborne-has-donated-more-than-1-2-million-books-to-children-in-underserved-us-schools-through-her-gift-of-books-programme/articleshow/135454189.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-08T01:00:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135454341,imgsize-744296.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Texas lawyer's seven-case fee dispute revived after appeals court questions firms' evidence]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135596668.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[R Kent Livesay, a former Texas attorney, is involved in a legal dispute regarding unpaid fees from several cases. After his disbarment, Livesay sought compensation from law firms for referrals made while licensed. The law firms argued that paying him would violate professional conduct rules. However, the appeals court found that sufficient evidence was not presented to support their claims.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-texas-lawyer-lost-his-licence-in-2018-and-later-sued-other-law-firms-for-fees-from-seven-client-cases-a-november-5-appeals-court-reopened-the-dispute-finding-insufficient-evidence-to-support-the-firms-defence/articleshow/135596668.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-texas-lawyer-lost-his-licence-in-2018-and-later-sued-other-law-firms-for-fees-from-seven-client-cases-a-november-5-appeals-court-reopened-the-dispute-finding-insufficient-evidence-to-support-the-firms-defence/articleshow/135596668.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-07T23:59:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135596855,imgsize-1369626.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Sofía Vergara joins St. Jude’s 2026 Thanks and Giving campaign]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135598177.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Sofía Vergara, along with other celebrities, is participating in the St. Jude Thanks and Giving campaign this year. The campaign aims to raise funds and awareness for childhood cancer and other illnesses affecting children. Celebrity ambassadors filmed holiday advertising segments with St. Jude patients, showcasing personal connections to the cause. Donations can be made online and through purchases at various participating retailers. St.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/sofa-vergara-returns-for-the-october-2026-launch-of-the-st-jude-thanks-and-giving-campaign-having-supported-it-for-15-years-the-hospital-says-its-research-has-helped-increase-the-us-childhood-cancer-survival-rate-from-20-to-more-than-80/articleshow/135598177.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/sofa-vergara-returns-for-the-october-2026-launch-of-the-st-jude-thanks-and-giving-campaign-having-supported-it-for-15-years-the-hospital-says-its-research-has-helped-increase-the-us-childhood-cancer-survival-rate-from-20-to-more-than-80/articleshow/135598177.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-07T23:57:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135598466,imgsize-196719.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[She became Uganda's first wildlife veterinarian: Meet Dr. Gladys Kalema-Zikusoka]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135616125.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Dr. Gladys Kalema-Zikusoka dedicates her efforts to conserving mountain gorillas in Uganda by engaging local communities and addressing health concerns. Through her organization, Conservation Through Public Health, she enhances the well-being of both gorillas and humans. Additionally, she founded Gorilla Conservation Coffee, which financially empowers farmers by promoting sustainable coffee farming while ensuring the protection of gorilla habitats, highlighting the necessity of teamwork in wildlife conservation and community development.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/she-became-ugandas-first-wildlife-veterinarian-and-dedicated-her-career-to-saving-mountain-gorillas-dr-gladys-kalema-zikusoka-built-a-model-that-protects-wildlife-while-supporting-local-communities/articleshow/135616125.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/she-became-ugandas-first-wildlife-veterinarian-and-dedicated-her-career-to-saving-mountain-gorillas-dr-gladys-kalema-zikusoka-built-a-model-that-protects-wildlife-while-supporting-local-communities/articleshow/135616125.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-07T23:54:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Lifestyle Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135627945,imgsize-113913.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Jelly Roll backs a 14-acre Nashville youth campus at his former juvenile centre]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135538856.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/jelly-roll-returned-to-the-juvenile-centre-in-nashville-where-he-spent-his-teenage-years-he-is-supporting-an-initiative-to-build-a-14-acre-youth-campus-on-the-site/articleshow/135538856.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/jelly-roll-returned-to-the-juvenile-centre-in-nashville-where-he-spent-his-teenage-years-he-is-supporting-an-initiative-to-build-a-14-acre-youth-campus-on-the-site/articleshow/135538856.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-08T00:00:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135538978,imgsize-86354.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Syria rules out troop deployment to Yemen, says military ties with Saudi could expand]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135643192.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Syria has clarified that it will not deploy troops to Yemen despite previous reports suggesting otherwise. A diplomatic source stated that military cooperation with Saudi Arabia is anticipated to deepen in the future. Saudi Arabia is currently facing tensions with the Houthi rebels and seeks military assistance from various allies. Syria and Saudi Arabia recently signed a defense cooperation agreement as ties between the countries strengthen.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/syria-rules-out-troop-deployment-to-yemen-says-military-ties-with-saudi-arabia-could-expand/articleshow/135643192.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/syria-rules-out-troop-deployment-to-yemen-says-military-ties-with-saudi-arabia-could-expand/articleshow/135643192.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-07T22:59:29+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Pranjal Pandey</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135643315,imgsize-248296.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Zelenskyy says Russia hit Ukrainian energy facility with North Korean KN-23 missiles]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135641759.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Ukrainian President Volodymyr Zelenskyy stated that Russia is using North Korean KN-23 missiles against Ukraine. He emphasized the need for stronger global sanctions against countries supplying military assistance. Zelenskyy noted a critical shortage of US-made Patriot missile interceptors affecting Ukraine's defense capabilities. Russia's intensified attacks are exacerbating the situation as winter approaches. Military cooperation between North Korea and Russia has significantly increased in recent months.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/defence/international/zelenskyy-says-russia-hit-ukrainian-energy-facility-with-north-korean-kn-23-missiles/articleshow/135641759.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/defence/international/zelenskyy-says-russia-hit-ukrainian-energy-facility-with-north-korean-kn-23-missiles/articleshow/135641759.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-07T21:59:35+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Pranjal Pandey</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135641785,imgsize-79884.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[First Muslim US senator-elect Abdul El-Sayed launches ‘Habibi PAC’ after railing against money in politics]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135643015.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/first-muslim-us-senator-elect-abdul-el-sayed-launches-habibi-pac-after-railing-against-money-in-politics/articleshow/135643015.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/first-muslim-us-senator-elect-abdul-el-sayed-launches-habibi-pac-after-railing-against-money-in-politics/articleshow/135643015.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-07T23:03:12+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Gokul Ankari</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135643513,imgsize-641175.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Justin Trudeau gets new role at Oxford University; will join Blavatnik School of Government as a fellow]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135640495.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/justin-trudeau-gets-new-role-at-oxford-university-will-join-blavatnik-school-of-government-as-a-fellow/articleshow/135640495.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/justin-trudeau-gets-new-role-at-oxford-university-will-join-blavatnik-school-of-government-as-a-fellow/articleshow/135640495.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-07T23:00:19+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Poulomi Ghosh</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135643331,imgsize-48646.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Brooklyn tenants faced a $120,000 claim after renting from a fake owner; court later dismissed it after a sale]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135632826.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[In a perplexing turn of events, Deborah and Demetris Jones rented an apartment under the false pretense of ownership in Brooklyn. Legal complications followed as the courts ruled the original landlord could no longer enforce tenancy agreements after selling the property. A subsequent settlement with the new owner granted the tenants temporary residence, illuminating significant considerations for tenants during changes in property ownership.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/brooklyn-tenants-rented-an-apartment-from-someone-falsely-claiming-to-own-it-then-faced-a-120000-judgment-sought-by-the-former-landlord-after-the-building-was-sold-again-a-new-york-court-dismissed-that-claim/articleshow/135632826.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/brooklyn-tenants-rented-an-apartment-from-someone-falsely-claiming-to-own-it-then-faced-a-120000-judgment-sought-by-the-former-landlord-after-the-building-was-sold-again-a-new-york-court-dismissed-that-claim/articleshow/135632826.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-07T22:22:20+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135632917,imgsize-1662768.cms"/></item></channel></rss>